<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>深检 on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/%E6%B7%B1%E6%A3%80/</link><description>Recent content in 深检 on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/%E6%B7%B1%E6%A3%80/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MiBeeNvr 的录像深检与全链路观测</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-deepcheck-observability/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-deepcheck-observability/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;监控链路里最难缠的故障是不报错的那种。直播画面卡住，可能是相机断流、网络抖动，也可能是 NVR 自己卡了——v0.12 之前可用的排障手段是看日志和数帧。录像侧更被动：拉流、封装、写盘每一环都返回成功，回放时画面却从某个时刻开始花掉，写入路径从头到尾没给过任何警告。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>